<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5. Results and Analysis ‣ An Evaluation of Context Length Extrapolation in Long Code via Positional Embeddings and Efficient Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Need of Better Evaluation Metrics</span>:</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In An Evaluation of Context Length Extrapolation in Long Code via Positional Embeddings and Efficient Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In An Evaluation of Context Length Extrapolation in Long Code via Positional Embeddings and Efficient Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
  <a id="license-tr" href="https://info.arxiv.org/help/license/index.html#licenses-available">
